      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استأسر لِلْعَدُوِ</span></b>  <i>He submitted himself as a
captive to the enemy.</i> (Mgh.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَأْسِرْ</span>,
meaning <i>Be thou a captive to me.</i> (S,) ＝   
